1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,920
W: I've got some outstanding news.

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:09,180
The inspector gave my new café a passing grade, so now I have permission to open it for business.

3
00:00:10,010 --> 00:00:11,180
M: I'm so happy for you.

4
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:13,910
When is the grand opening scheduled for?

5
00:00:14,330 --> 00:00:14,940
W: This Friday.

6
00:00:15,395 --> 00:00:18,020
Why don't you stop by if you have some time?

7
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:22,880
Drinks will be half off, and there will be live entertainment all day long.

8
00:00:23,555 --> 00:00:24,055
M: Okay.

9
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:26,245
I'll visit sometime after work.

10
00:00:26,725 --> 00:00:27,940
Where exactly is it located?

11
00:00:28,770 --> 00:00:31,520
W: It's on the corner of Macon Street and Bedford Drive.

12
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:34,635
It's right beside the big drugstore.

13
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:37,485
M: Oh, I know exactly where it is.
